 "comment": "Public map of OpenBao KV v2 (mount `secret`): names only, never values. paths: every path with purpose and consumer (checked by `mise run secrets:check`). pull: files `mise run secrets:pull` writes on a workstation (~ = home, else repo-relative). files: legacy secrets/<file> restored on demand by `mise run secrets:file`.",
